{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"2722","title":"Xiaomi Elevates Smart Living Experience with Latest AIoT Products","desc":"All-new 2-in-1 laptop, smart band, scooter, and TV bring users cutting-edge tech to make everyday life smarter","view_cnt":"11767","like_cnt":"0","add_time":"1655811603","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/525_operatorx_operatorx_opx/21/06/2022/6c4d782ce2cc26c961c41847f97dfc3f.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeijing, CHINA, June 21\u003c/strong\u003e - Xiaomi today announced the international release of a wide range of AIoT products designed to elevate smart experience in many facets of modern life, namely the Xiaomi Book S 12.4\", Xiaomi Smart Band 7, Xiaomi Electric Scooter 4 Pro, and Xiaomi TV A2 55\".\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/722_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/06/2022/59670eea16599a50003dc3714ddae03f.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProductivity meets versatility: Xiaomi Book S 12.4\"\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi’s first-ever 2-in-1 laptop is designed to elevate your mobile work experience, Xiaomi Book S 12.4” features a versatile 12.4” touchscreen that fits more information on screen for increased productivity. With 500 nits max brightness and a rich 2,560 x 1,600 resolution LCD detail, users can adjust brightness for excellent viewing in high resolution. Adding to the user viewing experience, Xiaomi Book S 12.4” offers a 100% sRGB color gamut display with more colors and greater detail.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe device delivers strong CPU performance with the Qualcomm Snapdragon™ 8cx Gen 2 compute platform. Also featured are dual microphones, dual 2W speakers, 13MP rear camera and 5MP front camera. Together with Windows 11 OS, Xiaomi Book S 12.4” delivers a comprehensive productivity experience. With a sleek, compact design, the device is a portable workstation packed with rich features. Finally, with Xiaomi Smart Pen and Keyboard support,\u003cem\u003e¹\u003c/em\u003e Xiaomi Book S 12.4” brings users’ thoughts and ideas to life.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eXiaomi Book S 12.4\" will be available at €699 via Xiaomi official channels.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/221_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/06/2022/2efd933932ee0a7214c201d8fe0ab98b.png\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStep up your game: Xiaomi Smart Band 7\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesigned for health enthusiasts, Xiaomi Smart Band 7 features a 1.62” full AMOLED high-resolution display, and a wider screen design with 25% increased visibility compared to the previous generation.² This provides more viewing space for information, and offers improved clarity and efficiency for users. With 110+ sport modes, users are empowered in setting personalized fitness goals that fit their lifestyle, for more personalized health and wellness. With three additional modes - Training load, Recovery duration and Training effect - users can evaluate and adjust their workout schedule and intensity for maximized performance.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe device features an all-new VO₂ max professional workout analysis, which measures the maximum amount of oxygen users can utilize during exercise. Xiaomi Smart Band 7 also provides sleep tracking, as well as SpO₂ and heart-rate monitoring.³ Xiaomi Smart Band 7 comes with 100+ watch faces, as well as multiple colorful strap options to match. The battery is designed to last up to 14 days on standby.\u003cem\u003e⁴\u003c/em\u003e Finally, with 5ATM water resistance,\u003cem\u003e⁵\u003c/em\u003e it’s ready to go rain or shine.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eXiaomi Smart Band 7 will be available at €49.9 via Xiaomi official channels.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/517_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/06/2022/285bb96a953c7457a0a6d3cb9cd3df73.png\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRide with power, go in comfort: Xiaomi Electric Scooter 4 Pro\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAs Xiaomi’s most powerful scooter to date, Xiaomi Electric Scooter 4 Pro features a 700W rated motor capable of 25km/h max speed.⁶ With a 12,400mAh capacity, it’s capable of covering distances up to 45km per charge and delivers the power to climb up to 20% inclines with ease.⁷\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Electric Scooter 4 Pro’s aerospace-grade aluminum body is lightweight, strong, and corrosion-resistant. The scooter is fitted with 10” tubeless self-sealing tires, which are designed to make the scooter tires puncture-resistant with Xiaomi DuraGel and more durable over rough roads.⁸ Xiaomi Electric Scooter 4 Pro’s larger size is capable of supporting more weight, and improves standing comfort. Additionally, the newly added magnetic charging port and lid ensure the charger is secure while plugged in.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesigned for a safe riding experience, users have access to both speed and safety with front eABS and rear dual-pad disc brake system. The upgraded UI on Xiaomi Electric Scooter 4 Pro’s instrument panel offers an experience free of distraction while offering useful information in an intuitive format.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eXiaomi Electric Scooter 4 Pro will be available at €649 via Xiaomi official channels.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/210_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/06/2022/5cc8c92c0e5cc735c43aef4abdec09db.png\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSmart life, limitless vision: Xiaomi TV A2 Series\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAs one of the most popular size variants for our users, Xiaomi TV A2 55” is a smart home hub device that offers streamlined AIoT connectivity, high-end audio and visual specs, and built-in access to content from around the world. With a sleek unibody metal frame supported by a single stand, Xiaomi TV A2 55” offers a limitless, bezel-less design for epic vision. Featuring a premium 4K Ultra HD Display with Dolby Vision®, Xiaomi TV A2 55” offers an immersive and true-to-life viewing experience from the comfort of home. With an ultra-wide 178° field of view, users can enjoy comfortable viewing from whichever angle suits their need. Xiaomi TV A2 55” also offers an immersive audio experience, coming equipped with Dolby Audio™.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eGoogle Assistant comes built-in on Xiaomi TV A2 55”,\u003cem\u003e⁹\u003c/em\u003e offering quick control of connected AIoT devices via the 360° Bluetooth remote control. Android TV™ also comes built-in,\u003cem\u003e¹ \u003c/em\u003e⁰\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003emeaning Xiaomi TV A2 55” offers access to movies and shows through users’ favorite apps, including Netflix, Prime Video, and YouTube, together with thousands of other apps via Google Play. The device also features Chromecast, offering a built-in tool to stream directly from phones, tablets, or laptops.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTo suit different households and consumer needs, Xiaomi TV A2 series is also available in 4 other sizes: 32”, 43”, 50”, 55” and 58”.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eXiaomi TV A2 55\" will be available at €529 via Xiaomi official channels.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/892_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/06/2022/c2e67fe5cc03221cef69455698b0ed1d.png\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eProduct images available here: \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/EloNrDOUnohMvg0txuVOlrMBBU1lHl2QPICxWfjSPtw6sA?e=XDsXpg\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eXiaomi Book S 12.4\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e, \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/EjSSwQLnkCtCtVG4wT3IvYkBMOad8xx8TRhqV2KH-lSpfQ?e=8N79IN\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eXiaomi Smart Band 7\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e, \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/EtzDMpPgD75Fj942rG0WZYABz5l8QRBomtk5pOEsn3jjPA?e=bgLuSP\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eXiaomi Electric Scooter 4 Pro \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eand \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/Emz8gcKlEKNJsN6MqjsYyaABS_nG0SAsL4OHyiT7zF9iwA?e=TI8RU3\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eXiaomi TV A2 Series\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹ Xiaomi Smart Pen and Keyboard sold separately.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e² The visible area of Xiaomi Smart Band 7 is approximately 25% larger compared to Xiaomi Smart Band 6. Data obtained from Xiaomi internal labs.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e³ This product and its features are not intended for diagnosis, prevention, monitoring, prediction, prognosis of any disease, investigation of physiological processes or any other medical purpose.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁴ The data of battery life is based on Typical Usage mode, tested by Xiaomi internal labs. Actual results may vary.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁵ 5ATM water resistance: Avoid sauna, hot shower, and swift currents during water sports.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁶ Maximum speed may vary by market depending on local regulations.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁷ All data obtained from Ninebot labs. Actual results may vary based on differences in use conditionsAll data obtained from Ninebot labs. Actual results may vary based on differences in use conditions.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁸ Punctures less than 3.5mm will be sealed by the sealing gel after the piercing object is removed\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁹ Google Assistant availability varies by market. Please refer to Google Assistant official website for more info.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹ \u003c/em\u003e⁰\u003cem\u003e Google, Android TV, Google Play and other related marks are trademarks of Google LLC.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"6808","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1655811600"},"common":null}